  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"p plus 34 equals q plus r\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation relates the variables <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"q\"><mi>q</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"q\"><mi>q</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math>?&nbsp;</p>",
