  "rationale": "<p>Choice B is correct. Subtracting <math alttext=\"34\"><mn>34</mn>\n</math> from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext=\"p equals q plus r minus 34\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Thus, the equation <math alttext=\"p equals q plus r minus 34\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> correctly expresses <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"q\"><mi>q</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"p minus 34 equals q plus r\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"p minus 34 equals negative q minus r\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"p plus 34 equals negative q minus r\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>34</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mi>q</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mi>r</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>",
